4717 0 obj
<<
/Title (The kaban holds historical significance  as a traditional household object that supported daily labor and domestic organization. As a toolbox, it facilitated manual work essential to livelihood and household maintenance. Its creation from locally sourced yakal wood demonstrates self-reliance, traditional woodworking skills, and sustainable use of natural resources. Moreover, as a handcrafted gift, it reflects familial values, labor, and personal expression embedded in everyday objects.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4713 0 R
>>
